{"speciesId":57,"names":{"fr":"Colossinge","es":"Primeape","en":"Primeape","ja":"オコリザル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"Always furious and tenacious to boot. It will not abandon chasing its quarry until it is caught."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"Always furious and tenacious to boot. It will not abandon chasing its quarry until it is caught."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"It stops being angry only when nobody else is around. To view this moment is very difficult."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"If approached while asleep, it may awaken and angrily give chase in a groggy state of semi-sleep."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It becomes wildly furious if it even senses someone looking at it. It chases anyone that meets its glare."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It will beat up anyone who makes it mad, even if it has to chase them until the end of the world."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"When PRIMEAPE becomes furious, its blood circulation is boosted. In turn, its muscles are made even stronger. However, it also becomes much less intelligent at the same time."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"When PRIMEAPE becomes furious, its blood circulation is boosted. In turn, its muscles are made even stronger. However, it also becomes much less intelligent at the same time."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"When it becomes furious, its blood circulation becomes more robust, and its muscles are made stronger. But it also becomes much less intelligent."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It is always outrageously furious. If it gives chase, it will tenaciously track the target no matter how far."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Always furious and tenacious to boot. It will not abandon chasing its quarry until it catches up."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It grows angry if you see its eyes and gets angrier if you run. If you beat it, it gets even madder."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It grows angry if you see its eyes and gets angrier if you run. If you beat it, it gets even madder."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It grows angry if you see its eyes and gets angrier if you run. If you beat it, it gets even madder."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"If approached while asleep, it may awaken and angrily give chase in a groggy state of semi-sleep."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It becomes wildly furious if it even senses someone looking at it. It chases anyone that meets its glare."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il grogne quand on le toise, rugit quand on s’enfuit et devient fou de rage quand on le frappe."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It grows angry if you see its eyes and gets angrier if you run. If you beat it, it gets even madder."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il grogne quand on le toise, rugit quand on s’enfuit et devient fou de rage quand on le frappe."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It grows angry if you see its eyes and gets angrier if you run. If you beat it, it gets even madder."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It grows angry if you see its eyes and gets angrier if you run. If you beat it, it gets even madder."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It grows angry if you see its eyes and gets angrier if you run. If you beat it, it gets even madder."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Sa fureur prend fin quand il n’a plus personne à frapper. Il est difficile d’en être témoin."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Solo se calma cuando nadie está cerca. Llegar a ver ese momento es realmente difícil."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It stops being angry only when nobody else is around. To view this moment is very difficult."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"まわりに だれも いないときだけは 怒るのを やめている。しかし それを 見るのは 難しい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ce Pokémon est constamment en rogne. Lorsqu’il traque une proie, il la pourchasse n’importe où, peu importe la distance."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Siempre está tremendamente enfadado. Cuando se empeña en una presa, no hay distancia para él."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It is always outrageously furious. If it gives chase, it will tenaciously track the target no matter how far."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"いつも 猛烈に 怒っており 逃げても 逃げても どこまでも 追いかけてくる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lorsque Colossinge devient furieux, sa circulation sanguine s’accélère. Du coup, ses muscles sont encore plus puissants. En revanche, il devient bien moins intelligent."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cuando Primeape se enfada, se le acelera el ritmo cardíaco y se le fortalecen los músculos. Con todo, pierde en inteligencia."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"When Primeape becomes furious, its blood circulation is boosted. In turn, its muscles are made even stronger. However, it also becomes much less intelligent at the same time."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"激しく 怒る ことで 血行が 良くなり 筋肉の 力を 強くするのだ。 ただし 頭の 回転は 遅くなるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lorsque Colossinge devient furieux, sa circulation sanguine s’accélère. Du coup, ses muscles sont encore plus puissants. En revanche, il devient bien moins intelligent."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cuando Primeape se enfada, se le acelera el ritmo cardíaco y se le fortalecen los músculos. Con todo, pierde en inteligencia."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"When Primeape becomes furious, its blood circulation is boosted. In turn, its muscles are made even stronger. However, it also becomes much less intelligent at the same time."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"激しく 怒る ことで 血行が 良くなり 筋肉の 力を 強くするのだ。 ただし 頭の 回転は 遅くなるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il arrive qu’il s’énerve tellement qu’il en meurt. Son visage, lorsqu’il meurt ainsi, est empreint d’une grande sérénité."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Se han conocido casos de Primeape que se han enfadado tanto que han llegado a fallecer. Aun así, sus rostros expresaban sosiego."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It has been known to become so angry that it dies as a result. Its face looks peaceful in death, however."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"あまりに 怒りすぎて そのまま 死んでしまうことが あるほどだが その死に顔は とても 安らか。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"D’après les recherches d’un certain scientifique, les Colossinge continuent de bouillonner de fureur même à l’intérieur d’une Poké Ball."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Según muestran los estudios de un investigador Pokémon, Primeape sigue enfadado incluso dentro de la Poké Ball."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Some researchers theorize that Primeape remains angry even when inside a Poké Ball."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"ある研究者の 学説では モンスターボールの 中でも オコリザルは 怒っているらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il ne pardonne rien et poursuit sans relâche ceux qui l’ont courroucé. Même les assommer ne suffira pas à apaiser sa rancune."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Si se enfada, perseguirá sin descanso al objeto de su enojo. Aun habiéndolo golpeado hasta la extenuación, seguirá guardándole rencor."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It will never forgive opponents who have angered it. Even after it has beaten them down until they can’t move, it never ever forgives."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"怒らせた 相手を 許さず 追い続ける。 叩きのめして 動かなくなっても まだ 許さない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Les vaisseaux sanguins de son cerveau étant plus résistants que ceux d’autres Pokémon, il peut rester en état de colère perpétuelle."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Los vasos sanguíneos de su cerebro son más fuertes que los de otros Pokémon, por lo que puede vivir en cólera perpetua sin problemas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"The blood vessels in its brain are sturdier than those of other Pokémon, so it can stay healthy despite its constant raging."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"他の ポケモンよりも 脳内の 血管が 丈夫なので 怒り 続けても 元気で いられるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Sa fureur prend fin quand il n’a plus personne à frapper. Il est difficile d’en être témoin."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Solo se calma cuando no hay nadie cerca, por lo que llegar a ver ese momento resulta verdaderamente difícil."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"It stops being angry only when nobody else is around. To view this moment is very difficult."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"まわりに 誰も いないときだけは 怒るのを やめている。しかし それを見るのは 難しい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Sa fureur prend fin quand il n’a plus personne à frapper. Il est difficile d’en être témoin."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Solo se calma cuando no hay nadie cerca, por lo que llegar a ver ese momento resulta verdaderamente difícil."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"It stops being angry only when nobody else is around. To view this moment is very difficult."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"まわりに 誰も いないときだけは 怒るのを やめている。しかし それを見るのは 難しい。"}],"varieties":[{"id":57,"moves":[{"name":"karate-chop","learns":[[1,"level-up",1],[1,"level-up",15],[2,"level-up",1],[2,"level-up",15],[3,"level-up",15],[4,"level-up",15],[5,"level-up",15],[6,"level-up",15],[7,"level-up",11],[8,"level-up",13],[9,"level-up",13],[10,"level-up",13],[11,"level-up",13],[12,"level-up",15],[13,"level-up",15],[14,"level-up",13],[15,"level-up",13],[16,"level-up",13],[17,"level-up",8],[18,"level-up",8],[19,"level-up",13],[28,"level-up",1],[28,"level-up",15],[29,"le